  _kind: 0
  _pose: 3
  _dialogText: If you're insolvent for five billing cycles in a row, that's soft bankruptcy. Most progress wipes: your cash, your lots besides the starter, your loans, your investments, your credit score back to 650. Your age, your Life Goals, and the bankruptcy mark on your record stay. The clock keeps ticking. Real reset, real consequence.
